      "Brand Limitation: Restricting the diet plans to only include Nestlé products may limit the variety and nutritional diversity of the plans, potentially compromising on the overall healthfulness.",
      "Perceived Bias: Users might question the nutritional advice provided, suspecting it to be biased towards promoting Nestlé products over more suitable or healthier alternatives.",
      "Implementation Complexity: Developing a platform that accurately personalizes nutrition plans, considering the vast differences in dietary needs, preferences, and local tastes, could be technologically and logistically challenging."
